pute cost but enables 5× ASG maximum (4 → 10 instances)\n- CloudFront cost increases 10× due to 10× traffic growth (200 GB → 2000 GB, 5M → 40M requests)\n- Database and load balancer costs remain constant; no upgrade needed\n- Original architecture fails to meet peak load requirement; proposed architecture has 50 req/s safety margin\n- Proposed architecture explicitly configures PITR and recovery retention to meet RPO/RTO targets"
